          "zh": [
            "AlphaGenome Atlas 绘制 DNA 变化的分子效应图谱。",
            "它专注于单字母 DNA 变异。",
            "该图谱涵盖人类基因组中 90 亿个此类变异。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The release of AlphaGenome Atlas provides a comprehensive dataset for understanding genetic variations, potentially accelerating AI-driven research in genomics and precision medicine. This tool may enhance predictive capabilities for disease risk and drug response by leveraging AI models on vast genomic data.",
          "zh": "AlphaGenome Atlas 的发布提供了理解基因变异的综合数据集，可能加速基因组学和精准医疗领域的 AI 驱动研究。该工具或能通过利用 AI 模型处理海量基因组数据，增强疾病风险和药物反应的预测能力。"
        },
